+/**
+ * Map a UniformPlanarArray element index to the index of the same element in the Sionna
+ * PlanarArray built from it. Both put the polarization outermost, but within a polarization
+ * UniformPlanarArray counts along each row starting from the bottom row, while PlanarArray
